<title>HONG KONG: ABN AMRO sets warrants on basket of HK stocks.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants on basket of HK stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on</p>
<p>Wednesday it is issuing 68 million American style-call warrants</p>
<p>on a basket of six Hong Kong blue-chip and red-chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd     0.1   shares</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc		  0.075 shares</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd		  0.15  shares</p>
<p> Guangdong Investment Ltd	 1.0   shares</p>
<p> Hutchison Whampoa Ltd	    0.2   shares</p>
<p> Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot;	    0.2   shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$53.91     PREMIUM	 11 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.26	GEARING	 4.8x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  29.DEC.97    EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 24.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$59.9025   LISTING DATE  27.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELVIERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
